# witness-enroll-pool-v0

pool_sha256: ecebb3ccf4a1ea72e73512ed5295634b06fceec86536a601015eaa39de973970
pool_version: 2
previous_pool_sha256: 96f8be7b1e3de7cb6a87a881281bb84cb408176bb050a7db45b7cdf90ec7d969
entries: 2

This entry fixes one version of the pool of day witnesses for FURUI day records. The draw for a day uses the pool of the latest entry of this kind that was appended before the ledger entry listing that day's record and is anchored in a Bitcoin block at or below that entry's block. The pool is the JSON on the pool_canonical line; its sha256 is pool_sha256. Procedure: https://github.com/ogasurfproject-jpg/horizon-shield/blob/main/workers/hs-ledger/nenrin/witness-enroll-v0/PROCEDURE.md
Establishes: that this pool existed no later than the block this entry is anchored to.
Does not establish: that anyone in the pool will answer a draw, or anything about their answers.

